Package: hapmapsnp6
Title: Sample data - Hapmap SNP 6.0 Affymetrix
Authors@R: c(
    person("Benilton", "Carvalho", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "benilton@unicamp.br",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5122-5646")),
    person("The International HapMap Consortium", role = "dtc"))
Version: 1.55.1
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0), ExperimentHub, Biobase
Suggests: oligo, oligoClasses, knitr, rmarkdown, BiocStyle, testthat
Description: Sample data from the International HapMap Project,
    generated on the Affymetrix Genome-Wide Human SNP Array 6.0 for the
    samples NA06985, NA06991 and NA06993. The package provides the three
    CEL files and the genotype calling result obtained from them with the
    crlmm algorithm. The data are hosted on Zenodo and served through
    ExperimentHub, and are intended only for demonstrating Bioconductor
    tools.
biocViews: ExperimentData, HapMap, SNPData, ExperimentHub, Genome
License: GPL
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/Bioconductor/hapmapsnp6
BugReports: https://github.com/Bioconductor/hapmapsnp6/issues
